index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..48b74242a32d4652ab1591e96e5590e9475d8394 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,18 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) keeps boards and sails in memory and prices and books
+their rental:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`: `kind` is `'board'` or `'sail'`, `dailyPrice` is euro cents per day.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns the total without booking.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item and returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+
+Periods are whole days: `start` and `end` are midnight UTC (`YYYY-MM-DD` or `YYYY-MM-DDT00:00:00Z`), and `end`
+is the start of the day after the last day. A booked item cannot be booked again for an overlapping period.
+Cancellations are not implemented yet.
+
+Build and test with `npm test`.
